Looking at this problem, I need to evaluate $\lim_{n\to\infty}\left(\sum_{k=1}^{2n}\frac{1}{\binom{2n}{k}}\right)^n$.

**Answer Leak Check:** The problem contains no leaked solutions or answer values. Proceeding.

